<title>USA: SPS Technologies president/COO to retire.</title>
<headline>SPS Technologies president/COO to retire.</headline>
<dateline>JENKINTOWN, Pa. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>SPS Technologies Inc said on Wednesday that Harry Wilkinson would retire as president and chief operating officer, effective March 1.</p>
<p>Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Charles Grigg will assume the additional title of president, the company said.</p>
<p>Wilkinson, who has been with SPS for 31 years, would remain on the company's board and continue to represent SPS in certain fastener industry activities, it said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
